          "quote": "The actor corrects its account within its grant; where\nresolving the disagreement needs an operation, a territory or a decision\noutside the grant, the step stops with `re_entry_requested(authority)`,\nnaming the owner of what it needs",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation/claude/9aee01ffa76cfbde1a6b8f1153a25bd6d71c216e/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F5.%20Work%20state%20and%20restart%2FThe%20workspace%20and%20an%20actor%27s%20account",
