      "key": "current_evidence_corrects_account",
      "statement": "Acquisition observes current subject and authoritative inputs. Current evidence corrects the account; undecidable matters remain explicit unknowns. Stored beliefs, summaries and successful prior results never overrule contrary current evidence. Reliance on a prior result requires current applicability and invalidator checks. Correction stays within grant; needed operation, territory or decision beyond grant causes a stop with re_entry_requested(authority), naming the needed owner.",
