          "start_line": 1582
        }
      ],
      "key": "method_execution_cost_and_family_scope",
      "statement": "Repeated acquisition, context assembly, hashing, activation preparation, status recording, review and evidence generation serve an identified change, decision or assurance need. Reuse requires exact applicability/invalidation; repetition adds neither validity nor independence. Material operational assumptions are qualified under referenced UP-019. Cost claims declare allowance and measured or unmeasured spend; separate concealable cost components, declare workloads/input dimensions before qualification and include context sent to every delegated actor. Context size is measured/fitted by referenced §2 step 3. No universal quota, ticket count, actor count, ledger or separate accounting carrier follows. The family has distinct instance premises: selected outcome; complexity-adding method obligations; a cost claim where governed; and bounded-resource activation. They are work conditions, not commitments derived from finitude alone. Delivery priority weighs likelihood, impact, reversibility, dependency and delayed feedback, with SPEC_METHOD §8 owning the smallest-supported-product-path default; probability waives no hard stop. Consumers apply owning rules without expanding their decisions.",
