          "end_line": 1721,
          "quote": "Invalidation withdraws the result from direct reliance; whether\nits evidence is retained on the new basis is decided by `retain_applicable`\nof FOUNDATIONS §4 Change impact and evidence reuse, and the changed\ncoordinate alone establishes neither that the claim fails nor that it\nholds.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-generation/claude/9aee01ffa76cfbde1a6b8f1153a25bd6d71c216e/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F7.%20Closed%20result%20and%20reuse",
          "start_line": 1717
